  "contract": [
    "Every Breath of the North rank (800838, 802386-802392) targets TARGET_UNIT_CONE_ENEMY_24 with a 12 yd radius.",
    "Without a spell_cone row the core read the enum suffix as 24 degrees (+/-12), so an enemy a few yards off the facing",
    "line escaped the breath, as #11592 reports. The first-rank spell_cone row restores 90 degrees (+/-45) for the chain,",
    "as for Flames of Xoroth, Dreadwake, Dawnbreak and Spirit Glaive. The harness places the target only along +x, so the",
    "Barbarian turns in place. Expected: the target straight ahead and 38 degrees off the facing (outside 24, inside 90)",
    "receives the 30 percent slow; at 60 and 120 degrees off it does not."
  ],
